---

This project's design trees were informed by field structures observed in
World Anvil's community RPG-block templates (https://github.com/iamromeo/worldanvil-templates),
used under their own World Anvil Community License. No code, markup, or assets
from that repository are included here — only original text organized around
similar section/field concepts. See README.md for full attribution.
